## 📖 Project Overview

This project is a simple rule-based chatbot developed in Python as part of the **CodeAlpha Python Programming Internship**. The chatbot responds to greetings and common user questions using predefined responses.

---

## ✨ Features

- Greets users
- Responds to common questions
- Handles goodbye messages
- Keyword-based responses
- Console-based interaction

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Random Module
- Functions
- Loops
- Conditional Statements
- String Handling

