## ▶️ How to Run

### Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/shubhmishra-1/CodeAlpha_Basic_Chatbot.git
```

### Navigate to the Project Folder

```bash
cd CodeAlpha_Basic_Chatbot
```

### Run the Program

```bash
python chatbotpython.py
```

